Error [jet.ProhibitedEffectReached]: `c_import_needs_ffi_c_in_allow_row::run` reaches the `FFI.C("c")` effect, which the package's `authority: { allow: […] }` row doesn't list
  --> tests/ui/c_import_needs_ffi_c_in_allow_row.jet:12:1
    |
 12 | run: fn() {
    | ^^^
 Why: A written `allow` row is a ceiling: the package's code and every call it makes may use only the listed effects and the floor every program holds (`IO`, `Mem.Alloc`, `Exec.Args`)
 Fix: Add `FFI.C("c")` to `authority.allow`, or remove the call that reaches it
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: c_import_needs_ffi_c_in_allow_row::run
